  "prefLabel": "Per 603.04 Filling Vacancies by Open Recruitment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 603.04 Filling Vacancies by Open Recruitment. When a vacancy is not filled by selecting an employee within the executive branch, the appointing authority shall notify the director of its intent to commence external recruitment pursuant to Per 402.\n\nSource. #8738, eff 10-18-06; amd by #10239, eff 3-18-13; ss by #10817, eff 5-17-15 (from Per 602.03); ss by #14433 (formerly Per 602.04), eff 12-1-25, EXPIRES 12-1-35",
